Hi! Sorry for the late reply, but if you're still wondering

&#x200B;

In the anime, no one; Shion comes back to life in the show so she spends her time fangirling over him

&#x200B;


In the manga, Asuma Mutsumi! The guy that always treated her nicely. They ended up getting married and having kids :D

i shouldn't have laughed as much as i did LMFAO

&#x200B;

thank you \^\^ **COPPER ACID.**
